From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:28:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 26/26] tst_qquickvideocroplayer: the views of a depth video
 reach the compositor as full side by side

depthNativeSubmission: a picture with its depth map (the depth layout of
Matroska's StereoMode 15) is handed to the stereo layer, and the buffer the
compositor receives is checked sample by sample: full side by side, the left
eye first, each eye at the size of the picture (cropped as the item crops
it), the red ramp and the rows of the picture intact, one eye the picture
itself and the other the picture moved along its rows by the parallax of the
depth map, and the eyes swapped when stereoSwapEyes says so. The rig can hold
a phase to capture the compositor's output (CROP_HOLD_DIR). The frame's
layout is given by its number, so that the same source builds against a Qt
Multimedia that does not know the depth layouts, where the test must fail.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
